 ## Background
-The method was presented at SIGGRAPH 2021 and authored by Silvia Sellán, Noam Aigerman and Alec Jacobson [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the principles of spacetime numerical continuation to solve for the minimum signed distance function over time.
